usage: course find [-h] [--root DIR] [-i] [--slides] REGEXP

positional arguments:
  REGEXP             a Go regexp (RE2), matched line by line

options:
  -h, --help         show this help message and exit
  --root DIR         niagara-research checkout (default: $NIAGARA_RESEARCH_DIR, then found from
                     cwd)
  -i, --ignore-case  ignore case
  --slides           search the course text files instead (slide decks, BQL reference, lab and
                     review instructions): one <deck>:<line>: <text> row per matching line
